From 72643e1493417c8d5b7779aa789ea58eb291e814 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Do <david.do@openkingdom.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:03:01 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] netgen: chan sinh mang khi phat hanh genesis vuot tran
 cung (tran nguoc uint64)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phat hien khi soat buoc re-genesis: HANDOFF ghi buoc con lai la "gen-network.sh 9
+ down -v && up -d", KHONG nhac build lai image node. Nhung SupplyCap la hang so
BIEN DICH VAO BINARY (config/config.go xep 9001 cung nhom Mainnet/Fuji nen co CLI
--stake-supply-cap bi vo hieu — dung y do, xem chu thich tai cho).

Server dang chay binary co: do that
  docker logs 9chain-a1-node-1 | head -1  ->  "supplyCap":720000000000000000
Nap genesis moi (phat hanh 5,4 ty) len binary do thi reward/calculator.go:56
  remainingSupply := c.supplyCap - currentSupply
tru uint64 THO, khong kiem dau => tran nguoc:
  720.000.000.000.000.000 - 5.400.000.000.000.000.000 mod 2^64
  = 13.766.744.073.709.551.616  (= 13.766.744.073 LOVE9)
Lon hon ca tran 9 ty dinh dat. Va buoc SetCurrentSupply(currentSupply + reward)
khi do len 19.166.744.073.709.551.616 > uint64 max — tuc lap luan cua D-039
("cong uint64 tho khong the tran") chi dung KHI currentSupply <= supplyCap.

Khong tang nao khac bat duoc: avalanchego KHONG kiem initialSupply <= supplyCap
o bat ky dau (grep SupplyCap toan repo). Node khoi dong sach, RPC xanh, smoke test
xanh — sai lech chi lo o phan thuong staking, nhieu ngay sau khi mang da cong khai.

Sua:
- netgen doc SupplyCap THANG tu genesis.A1Params (cung module, khong co ly do chep
  tay). Bo hang so chep tay vua them o commit truoc.
- `mustFitSupplyCap()` chay TRUOC khi sinh khoa, chet han neu vuot tran.
- Chu thich tai cho SupplyCap noi ro: doi no = phai build lai image, khong chi sinh
  lai genesis. Chu thich cu con mo ta 720 trieu / phat hanh 400 trieu.

⚠️ Cong nay chi doi chieu bang phan bo voi binary DANG BIEN DICH RA NETGEN. No
KHONG nhin thay image chay tren server — deploy genesis moi len image cu van lot.
Do la viec cua quy trinh deploy.

Nghiem thu (golang:1.25.10-bookworm, /src mount read-only, thay file bang -overlay):
  ca thuan (tran 9 ty)      -> exit 0, 14 tep, "Tong phat hanh 5,400,000,000 LOVE9"
  doi chung nguoc (720 tr)  -> exit 1, 0 tep sinh ra, in dung so tran nguoc

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
